# Static Contact Form Configuration (Choose one service)

# OPTION 1: Web3Forms (Recommended - Default)
# 1. Enter your email at https://web3forms.com
# 2. Receive your free public access key in 15 seconds
# 3. Paste it below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# OPTION 2: Formspree (Alternative)
# 1. Create a free account & form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Paste your form ID below (e.g., mbjnvzyq):
# VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=your_formspree_form_id_here
